Virtual Boot compatibility patch 0010
=====================================

This patch records the link-time compatibility changes applied by the
GitHub Actions workflow to the Samsung kernel branch.

- Remove references to the unavailable exynos_cpu power-state table from
  optional snapshot and cpuidle diagnostic paths.
- Provide deterministic defaults for optional Samsung accessory/display
  state globals used by DWC3 and HID.
- Keep MCT hard-lockup notifier integration conditional on the generic
  hard-lockup detector.
- Enable the kernel networking and MMC command-queue implementations
  required by the existing GUD and MMC queue call sites.
- Enable Samsung SEC_DEBUG so F2FS debug-hook globals are linked.

The workflow applies guarded, idempotent source transformations and verifies
each anchor before continuing. These changes do not alter boot/recovery
partition handling or the phone.
